###get documents
GET http://localhost:3000/api/documents

###add documentation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "1",
  "denomination": "Escritura",
  "format": "pdf",
  "file": ""
}

###get documentation by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/documents/1

###update documentation by id
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/documents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "denomination": "Escritura Actualizada"
}

###delete documentation by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/documents/1